==Production==
=== Development ===
In 1982, [[Sachin Pilgaonkar|Sachin]] thought of this film, but he dropped the idea because of the budget. After 21 years, he wanted to make the film again. This time, he asked [[Santosh Pawar]] to write the script. The initial title for the film was ''Chala Na Gade'', but later [[Santosh Pawar|Santosh]] suggested the title ''Navra Maza Navsacha''.<ref>{{Cite web |last= |date= |title='नवरा माझा नवसाचा'नंतर १८ वर्षांनी एकत्र येणार सचिन पिळगावकर-संतोष पवारची जोडी |url=https://www.lokmat.com/filmy/marathi-cinema/sachin-pilgaonkar-and-santosh-pawar-marathi-actors-will-work-together-after-18-years-a-a945/ |access-date= |website=Lokmat |language=mr}}</ref>

===Casting===
[[Sachin Pilgaonkar|Sachin]] originally did not choose himself for the role of Vakratund; [[Bharat Jadhav]] was selected for the part. [[Supriya Pilgaonkar]] was cast for the cameo of Sheila Raje. However, one of Sachin’s friends suggested that both he and Supriya should take the lead roles. As a result, Sachin and Supriya were chosen to play Vakratund and Bhakti, while [[Reema Lagoo]] took over the cameo role of Sheila Raje. [[Ashok Saraf]] was the first choice for the role of conductor Lalu, and he accepted it.<ref>{{Cite web |last= |first= |title=सचिन नाही तर 'हा' अभिनेता साकारणार होता 'नवरा माझा नवसाचा'मध्ये मुख्य भूमिका; सुप्रियाही दिसणार होत्या भलत्याच भूमिकेत |url=https://www.esakal.com/premier/navara-maza-navsacha-unknown-facts-sachin-pilgaonkar-selected-bharat-jadhav-for-lead-role-in-movie-psn14 |access-date= |website=Marathi News Esakal |language=mr}}</ref> [[Laxmikant Berde]] was initially selected for the role of Babu Kalia, but due to his poor health, the role was given to [[Pradeep Patwardhan]].<ref>{{Cite web |title='नवरा माझा नवसाचा'मध्ये दिसले असते लक्ष्मीकांत बेर्डे; शूटिंग सुरू असतानाच केलं अ‍ॅडमिट अन् ४ महिन्यात... |url=https://maharashtratimes.com/entertainment/entertainment-news/bollywood-news/laxmikant-berde-was-a-part-of-navara-maza-navsacha-but-got-hospitalised-during-shoot/articleshow/109662782.cms |access-date= |website=Maharashtra Times}}</ref> [[Madhurani Gokhale]] was chosen for the role of VJ after auditioning. Her character has a brush, which she believes is a microphone. Interestingly, she got that brush from [[Dadar]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=2024-08-05 |title=इंग्रजी भाषा, ब्रशवाला माइक अन् रिमा लागूंना पाहिल्यानंतरची प्रतिक्रिया, मधुराणी प्रभुलकरने सांगितले 'नवरा माझा नवसाचा'मधील किस्से |url=https://www.loksatta.com/manoranjan/marathi-cinema/madhurani-prabhulkar-shares-memories-of-navra-maza-navsacha-movie-pps-98-4519016/ |access-date= |website=Loksatta |language=mr}}</ref>

===Filming===
The entire film was shot in [[Konkan]]. Several portions were shot in [[Film City, Mumbai|Film City]] and on [[Kurla]] bus depot.<ref>{{Cite web |title=कोकणात या ठिकाणी सुरू आहे 'नवरा माझा नवसाचा २'चं शूटिंग, समोर आले खास व्हिडिओ |url=https://maharashtratimes.com/entertainment/entertainment-news/bollywood-news/navra-maza-navsacha-2-sequel-marathi-movie-shooting-in-ratnagiri-video-viral/articleshow/108700174.cms |access-date= |website=Maharashtra Times}}</ref>

